        {
          "text": "INkosi yasikhuluma kuMozisi isithi kuAroni: Thatha induku yakho, welule isandla sakho phezu kwamanzi eGibhithe, phezu kwemifula yabo, phezu kwemifula yabo, laphezu kwamachibi abo laphezu kwawo wonke amachibi abo amanzi, ukuze abe yigazi, futhi kube khona igazi ezweni lonke laseGibhithe, ezitsheni zokhuni nasezitsheni zamatshe.",
