          "text": "OMose no-Aroni benza njengalokho uJehova ebayalile; waphakamisa udondolo, washaya amanzi aseNayile phambi kwamehlo kaFaro naphambi kwamehlo ezinceku zakhe; futhi onke amanzi omfula aphenduka igazi.",
